OL,3,A#200m taxpayer-funded trains sit barely
OL,4,Aused for three years
OL,5,
OL,6,FTfW chief executive James Price said he
OL,7,Fwants trains that work "100% well, 100%
OL,8,Fof the time" before putting them into
OL,9,Ffull service.
